                                "sense_id": "bc52f245-802c-3eca-9e37-538bff8b66c8",
                                "text": "Then seemed it that a tameless hurricane / Arose, and bore me in its dark career / Beyond the sun, beyond the stars that wane / On the verge of formless space […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3336e4a8-4e87-43a3-baea-0bb94ba328b2",
                                "sense_id": "bc52f245-802c-3eca-9e37-538bff8b66c8",
                                "text": "[W]hen the guard came to fetch the tameless convict, they found him on his knees in a corner, sobbing like a child."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
